  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A ball of mass 0.4 kg is attached to a string of length 0.8 m. The ball is rotated in a vertical circle such that the speed at the lowest position is 6.0 m s<sup>−1</sup>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the tension in the string when the ball is at the lowest position?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">4.0 N</li><li data-label=\"B\">14 N</li><li data-label=\"C\">18 N</li><li data-label=\"D\">22 N</li></ol>"
  },
